## React Hook
  -Special function of react -data maintain, performance optimize, Effect listen, globally state manage, caching maintain
  - can be used within react components only within custom hook

## State and Effect

 useEffect(() => {
    console.log("If any of the states in this component is changes/ for any render of this component");
    
  })

  useEffect(() => {
    console.log("Only called for the first time when component is mounted");
    
  },[]);

  useEffect(() => {
    console.log("This hook gets loaded for any of the isSubmitting is changes");
  },[isSubmitting])



## Types of Application
  a. 'REST'
    -overall web development under http protocol
  b. 'SOAP'
      -Secured connection (Fintech Product)
  c. 'GraphSQL'
      -With heavy data set, controlled and called by FE
  d. 'gRPC'
      -Server to server for microservice based architecture


